sk-tweets-2010-to-2025-march?datasetVersionNumber=11","text_status":"captured_source_text","text_source":"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/dadalyndell/elon-musk-tweets-2010-to-2025-march","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-152517033207136256","post_id":"152517033207136256","platform":"x","author":"elonmusk","original_url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152517033207136256","published_at":"2011-12-29T22:31:09.003Z","published_date":"2011-12-29","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["aryansingh0909/elon-musk-tweets-updated-daily","dadalyndell/elon-musk-tweets-2010-to-2025-march"],"text":"Interesting Economist article about how humanity's collective actions have created a fundamentally new geological age -- the Anthropocene.","like_count":157,"likes_captured_at":"2025-04-13T22:30:20.703Z","likes_source":"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/dadalyndell/elon-musk-tweets-2010-to-2025-march?datasetVersionNumber=11","text_status":"captured_source_text","text_source":"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/dadalyndell/elon-musk-tweets-2010-to-2025-march","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-152394000857448448","post_id":"152394000857448448","platform":"x","author":"elonmusk","original_url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152394000857448448","published_at":"2011-12-29T14:22:15.805Z","published_date":"2011-12-29","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["aryansingh0909/elon-musk-tweets-updated-daily","dadalyndell/elon-musk-tweets-2010-to-2025-march"],"text":"@om Cool personal essay. It really resonated with me, as I felt the same way after coming very close to dying from malaria ten years ago.","like_count":50,"likes_captured_at":"2025-04-13T22:30:20.703Z","likes_source":"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/dadalyndell/elon-musk-tweets-2010-to-2025-march?datasetVersionNumber=11","text_status":"captured_source_text","text_source":"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/dadalyndell/elon-musk-tweets-2010-to-2025-march","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-152315925167742977","post_id":"15231592516774297